        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Bisecting an angle requires: (1) Drawing an arc from the vertex to intersect both arms, (2) Drawing arcs from the intersection points to find the bisector, and (3) Joining the vertex to the new intersection. <b>Drawing a perpendicular line from the vertex</b> is unnecessary.</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
        "comments_count": 0,
        "options": [
